WEBVTT

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:06.380
Ho-hum, I wish winter vacation comes soon...

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.630
Come on, Moe. Summer vacation just ended.

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:10.860
Oh, I see.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.660
Hey look, that’s Fujiwara Zakuro!

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:20.940
Say, I heard that Fujiwara Zakuro was
chosen as this year’s Best Dresser.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.410
How beautiful!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:26.630
Wow great, Zakuro-san
is on the poster!

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:31.590
Oh, it’s a pair of rings...

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:49.510
Ichigo!

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:50.550
Huh?

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.890
What’s up? You are blushing.

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:54.220
Oh! Matching rings?

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:55.390
Haa...

00:00:55.390 --> 00:00:58.410
You’re already THAT close to him?

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:01.480
No, no. I’m just imagining...

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:02.660
About what?

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.320
Well, I was thinking of getting a pair of rings with Aoyama-kun,

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.040
locked in each other’s gaze...

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.040
Oh, Aoyama-kun!

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.420
Aaaaaah!

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.450
What are you doing? Shopping?

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:12.360
Uh, well...

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:16.180
Guess what, Ichigo imagined about putting
a ring with you... looking at each other...

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:17.450
AAAAAAAHH~!!

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:20.250
No, no, no! Nothing like that!

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:23.420
AHH!

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.600
What’s wrong?

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:28.600
Well, in case it rains...

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.070
We’re in the arcade now...

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.360
Oh dang! I think I’m late for work!

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.530
See you later! Bye!

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.890
What’s wrong with Ichigo?

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.720
Heh, it happens.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.990
That’s tough for you.

00:01:51.490 --> 00:01:53.280
Phew, that was scary.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.970
Aoyama-kun is always popping out of nowhere.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:58.980
Hello!

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:00.290
Oneesama, please.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:03.180
Please let me attend to you.

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:05.790
Minto is crying! Minto is crying!

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:06.790
What’s wrong?

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:07.670
Well...

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:11.170
Ichigo-oneechan showed up
at the wrong time!

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:13.360
Ichigo! I won’t forgive you!

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:17.390
Minto is angry! Minto is angry!

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:18.890
What’s going on?

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:22.600
Zakuro-oneechan’s attendant
caught a cold.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:28.110
So Zakuro wants Ichigo to temporarily take over...

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.540
Why me?

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:32.950
That’s right. Why not me?

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:36.070
I’m more useful than that uncivilized Ichigo!

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:38.700
Hey! What are you saying?!

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.800
It’s a matter of brawn.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.710
Bra-wn?

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:44.680
See you tomorrow.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.360
Basically, being an attendant needs physical labor.

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:02.930
This is too heavy, even for me...

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:05.980
Ichigo-oneechan, the spirit of cooperation
is important for all.

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:07.500
We’re friends, aren’t we?

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.370
Surely, this isn’t a job for me.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:14.900
So, where are you going today?

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:18.590
The rehearsal of Pop Jewelry’s roll-out, isn’t it?

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.240
Yes.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.510
I’ll need your help.

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.510
Pop Jewelry?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.470
Ah, that pair-ring’s..

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.430
Sure! I’m glad to be of help.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:30.940
Ichigo!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.760
Tart, is that information reliable?

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:41.610
Of course, I have confidence
in it this time.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.070
But the data is insufficient.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.490
It’s fine, I’m sure tomorrow...

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:49.650
...we’ll surely get the Mew Aqua.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:02.840
Zakuro is so beautiful...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.300
Brilliant, like jewels...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:11.750
Yamada! You’re spacing out again. Have you finished cleaning the stage yet??

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:12.940
I’m sorry!

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:18.090
Shit, what are you doing at a time like this?!?

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.260
I’m sorry!

00:04:19.260 --> 00:04:20.930
Hurry and clean it up!

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:21.860
Y-Y-Yes sir.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.400
Is that the pair of rings?

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.250
It’s you again!?

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:37.960
I’m busy, give me a break.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:40.210
Well, sir...

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:44.380
Listen, that apparel’s too plain for the main event.

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:49.640
It’s true it looks plain, but this Rainbow Stone...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.750
What? Argh, shit! Say more clearly!

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:53.850
Nevermind, please forget it.

00:05:06.680 --> 00:05:07.780
Watch out!

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:16.580
Are you okay?

00:05:18.030 --> 00:05:19.790
Yes, I’m fine...

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:21.090
Who are you?

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.700
I’m Ichigo, Momomiya Ichigo.

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.830
I’m attending on Fujiwara Zakuro
for a short period of time.

00:05:26.830 --> 00:05:29.710
You know, this box is kind of heavy.

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.890
Where should I place it?

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.380
Oh sorry, I’ll take it.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:36.630
Don’t worry about it, I have confidence in my strength.

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:38.170
Then, please put it down here.

00:05:38.170 --> 00:05:39.060
Okay.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:44.740
Oh dear, it’s in a mess.

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.110
I’ll help you!

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:52.850
W-W-What’s wrong!?

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:53.980
I’m sorry.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:58.480
Since I’m always messing up, everybody ignores me,

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:00.800
and yet you are kind to me...

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:04.800
Well Miss, will you tell me
your name please?

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:07.970
Yes, my name is Yamada Tsukiko.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:11.430
Then, just leave it with me!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.630
I’m stronger than a hundred men!

00:06:18.170 --> 00:06:20.760
I can’t wait to see the show.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:24.940
The gems I polished daily, is all for tomorrow.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:30.860
So, I was really impressed when
I saw Zakuro-san at rehearsal,

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:34.860
...because both she and the gems shone so bright...

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:40.960
But the truth is, I think she’ll look
much better with another stone,

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:43.920
...called the “Rainbow Stone”.

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:48.760
I think, the intrinsic value of jewel is not its price...

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:51.830
...but its ability to brighten whoever whom wears it.

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.830
The Rainbow Stone looks a little modest,

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.680
but it has magical charm – it can give brightness to a girl.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:06:59.850
That sounds wonderful.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:05.220
But even if I raised this to the chief, he may not believe it.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.150
Why’s that?

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:09.360
’Cause I’m a bad worker...

00:07:14.770 --> 00:07:16.520
Isn’t it weird?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:22.200
...my life is not bright at all,
in spite of my love for jewelry,

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.950
they only brighten someone else’s life...

00:07:31.210 --> 00:07:32.540
Please take a look.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:34.970
This is the jewel that’s called the “Rainbow Stone”.

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:37.580
It looks rather plain.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.330
What’s the matter with it?

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:45.380
Yes, after asking a specialized agency
to investigate Mew Aqua’s dew,

00:07:45.380 --> 00:07:49.990
We found only the Rainbow Stone
can give a reaction to it.

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:54.060
You mean this stone is
made of Mew Aqua?

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:55.950
I don’t know, but...

00:07:55.950 --> 00:07:58.310
It’s worth trying.

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:02.520
This stone is very rare, but when
I researched on it awhile ago,

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:05.760
I heard there’s one on
Zakuro’s show list.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:09.960
In that case, let’s go to the Pop Jewelry
show and see this stone!

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:12.880
Ah.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.930
Tsukiko-san? I just had a good idea.

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:22.480
Would you speak to Zakuro about this idea?

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:28.550
That’s why, she couldn’t ask her chief about this,

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:32.520
but she wants you to put on the Rainbow Stone.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:38.280
Yes, with Zakuro-san wearing the Rainbow Stone,

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:41.190
I’m sure its charm will be
ever more brilliant.

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:42.650
I refuse.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.160
Zakuro-san, why?

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:47.130
If you are sincere about it, you should ask chief yourself.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:51.590
It’s useless, nobody listens to me.

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.090
That’s your final answer?

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.840
Yes, because I have no power to...

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:57.710
Then let it go.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.800
Ehh?

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.100
Zakuro? That was so mean!

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:08.350
Zakuro-san!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:27.400
<i>Thank you for visiting Pop Jewelry’s
autumn collection showcase.</i>

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.120
<i>This show will start soon.</i>

00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.880
The show’s about to open but Tsukiko-san’s missing.

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:48.310
She has polished gems every day for todays show.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:52.280
Zakuro-san, it is about time
for the interview.

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.780
Could you wait a second?

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:57.240
I don’t know...

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.570
I’ll be right over.

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:06.450
I’m really a failure...

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:08.170
<i>That’s not true.</i>

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:13.800
<i>Every girl can shine bright.</i>

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:16.760
<i>Could you share the secret to that?</i>

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:20.720
<i>Girls are rough diamonds in nature.</i>

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:26.680
<i>It’s important that they find their shine on their own.</i>

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:35.940
<i>Now we shall begin the showcase of
Pop Jewelry’s autumn collection.</i>

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:40.090
<i>Leading the show is the
“Blue Sky” Aquamarine series,</i>

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.940
<i>as beautiful as the fine autumn sky.</i>

00:11:00.330 --> 00:11:01.930
This is the next one.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.620
You came back!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:05.050
Thank you...

00:11:05.050 --> 00:11:09.650
I was always giving up, and didn’t
try to shine by my own effort.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:13.610
I’ll try to ask the chief again!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.440
Hello? Shirogane?

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.890
What? The Rainbow Stone
is a Mew Aqua?

00:11:19.890 --> 00:11:21.930
<i>Nope, I said it’s just a possibility...</i>

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.450
<i>But I don’t know what will happen, be careful.</i>

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:28.950
Be careful of what!? Geez, what did he mean?

00:11:30.150 --> 00:11:34.380
I beg of you! Please use this Rainbow
Stone for the main show!

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.950
This stone have the power to make a girl shine!

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:40.340
It gives a girl courage!

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.430
Well then, why don’t you wear it to prove to us.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:52.840
To begin with, what do you know about jewelry?

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.920
Anyway, the show has started now.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:57.070
Let’s get to work!

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.930
How can he say that?

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:05.390
The jewels are bright because Tsukiko
tried her best to polish them.

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.080
A struggle? How nice.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:08.620
Quiche!

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:12.900
Wow, a reaction... from this!?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:13.980
Return it!

00:12:13.980 --> 00:12:15.960
Quiche! Let her go!

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:22.970
I’ll never give you this stone!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:26.720
Tsukiko-san! Look out!

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.760
Tsukiko-san!?

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:39.220
Rainbow Stone...

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.610
Tsukiko, hold on to yourself!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:44.930
Ichigo, I’ll leave the
Rainbow Stone to you.

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.850
I got it.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.580
Quiche, I won’t forgive you!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.900
That was easy.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:54.000
I’ll take this. Bye, Ichigo!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:55.170
Hey! Wait!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:04.290
Cripes, Ichigo, maybe you want a kiss?

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.840
Stop joking!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.390
You...!

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:17.970
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:56.550
<i>The next is, the number 8...</i>

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:56.540
Masha!

00:13:56.540 --> 00:13:57.090
Masha!

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:59.230
<i>This work was made in the motif
of passionate, red jewelry.</i>

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.230
Alien, alien!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.470
Mew Mew Mint!

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:01.380
Mew Mew Lettuce!

00:14:01.380 --> 00:14:02.590
Mew Mew Pudding!

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:05.050
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:06.950
Oh, you guys are here?

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:07.970
Pie!

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:08.910
Tart!

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:12.770
You know, I’m the one who found this Mew Aqua.

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:13.870
Don’t try to steal it!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:17.240
I’m not trying to steal it; I am the one who found it first!

00:14:18.230 --> 00:14:19.210
Oh, wait!

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:20.930
That’s...!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:21.780
Rainbow Stone!

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.190
We found it!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.000
I’m first!

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:26.620
I did it!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:27.680
No!

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:34.000
Shit! We have no time to attend to kids.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.980
You’re a child yourself!

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:37.340
What did you say...!

00:14:37.340 --> 00:14:39.310
I got the Rainbow Stone!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:42.270
Minto, I’ll take care of things here.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:44.180
Ok, Bu-Ling.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.860
Fuu-shi-sen!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.370
Mew Mint, leave it to me.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.370
I leave it to you!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:03.340
Hey wait!

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:13.300
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.440
My Strawberry Surprise had no effect!

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.380
That’s tough luck Ichigo,

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:28.400
but its carapace is made of diamond,
the hardest stone in the world.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:29.610
Diamond!?

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.820
Well, the next is, “A Diamond
is Forever” brightness attack!

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:39.660
Argh... my eyes!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.370
Use the finishing blow,
Chimera turtle!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.080
Blue Knight!

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:53.390
You’re here too!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.850
I’m always watching out for you...

00:15:57.280 --> 00:16:00.460
Mew Strawberry, they took the Rainbow Stone!

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.770
Oh no! We have to get it back.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:03.960
Let’s deal with that first!

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:04.560
YES!!

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.070
Good, come on...

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:24.420
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.550
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:38.710
It’s useless...

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:40.470
It reflects all attacks.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:43.550
That chimera have no weak point?

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:44.590
Don’t give up!

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:45.440
Blue Knight!

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.610
Can you hit him with another attack?

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:51.690
Yes, of course!

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.820
Then I’ll leave it to you.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:03.540
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:05.830
Reborn... Lettuce RUSH!

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.830
Hehe, it’s meaningless...

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:15.380
Huwah!

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:19.600
I can’t get up...!

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:40.040
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.400
Because it’s a turtle,

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:51.910
that’s why it couldn’t get up.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.300
We defeated them! Yatta!

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.050
Well, I successfully delayed them.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:03.520
Return this stone.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.730
Reborn... Pomegran’ SPEAR!!

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:16.930
Cut it out!

00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.370
We don’t want to fight for nothing.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:19.570
What do you mean?

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:23.440
It’s just an ordinary stone that reacts to Mew Aqua.

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:26.620
It doesn’t have any value – for both of us.

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:33.530
It is not just an ordinary stone,

00:18:33.530 --> 00:18:35.210
...for girls at least.

